MODULE: BudgetForceFaultAttributedWrongOwner
TARGET: BudgetForceFaultAttributed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: budget fault is charged to another physical tree and shard
PERTURBS: DrainFinish

--- FIND
       IN /\ faultOwner' = IF expired THEN Owner ELSE faultOwner
--- REPLACE
       IN /\ faultOwner' = IF expired THEN <<"tree-B", 2>> ELSE faultOwner
          \* MUTATION: wrong budget-fault attribution.
--- END
